<title>USA: Esterline names chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Esterline names chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esterline Technologies Corp said on Monday it named Robert Cremin as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Esterline said the newly created position gives Cremin overall corporate responsibility for Esterline's 13 units. Cremin has worked at Esterline for the past 20 years.</p>
<p>Esterline is a manufacturer of engineered products for the commercial aircraft, aerospace and defense industries.</p>
